{"type":"text","timestamp":1794540457230,"sessionID":"ses_e2d114c1cffeCJAo2qUfV4UXZv","part":{"id":"prt_1d2f23d11001WpR5W1EKc7aEwS","sessionID":"ses_e2d114c1cffeCJAo2qUfV4UXZv","messageID":"msg_1d2f2365b001R9H3kJuGiwStCe","type":"text","text":"T012 is implemented and both verify commands pass.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts` (modified): imported `TRACKED_COMMANDS` and `typedCommandIn` from `../command-attach.js`, exported `rankTypedCommandOwnerFirst(ranked, promptLower)` with the durable-why comment, and called it in `scoreAdvisorPrompt` after `applyDoctorHelperHandoff` and before `const passing`.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/scorer/typed-command-owner.vitest.ts` (new): four cases covering `/create:goal x` moving `sk-doc` first from index 1 with the other entry order kept, the same with `sk-doc` not passing changing nothing, `/speckit:save x` with a scorer row changing nothing, and a no-slash prompt changing nothing.\n\n**Verify output**\n```\n$ npx vitest run tests/scorer/typed-command-owner.vitest.ts   (in ADV)\nVFT_EXIT:0\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  4 passed (4)\n```\n```\n$ npm run typecheck   (in ADV)\nTC_EXIT:0\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\n```\n\nNegative control: the same vitest file was created before the implementation and failed 4 of 4 with `rankTypedCommandOwnerFirst is not a function`, so the pass is caused by the change.\n\n**Status**\n- Observed: the two files above are the only paths changed by this task (`git status` shows `fusion.ts` modified and the test file untracked). The checkbox in `tasks.md` was left unticked.\n- State: edited, not committed, not staged, on branch `worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research`.\n- Inferred: nothing material. The scorer call site was verified by reading the diff, not by a live advisor run.\n- Residual risk: none known. `fusion.ts` now